# The backend that owns products, orders, stock and Paystack.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ means it is inlined into the browser bundle, which is correct
# here: this is a public base URL, not a secret. This storefront holds no
# secrets at all — no API keys, no database credentials, no Paystack keys.
# If something here ever needs to be secret, it belongs on the backend.
#
# Leave it empty and the shop renders from the placeholder catalogue in
# src/lib/fixtures.ts so the frontend stays developable. Orders need a real
# backend either way.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=""
